from pathlib import Path
import json,html,subprocess,sys,socket
ROOT=Path(__file__).resolve().parents[3];OUT=ROOT/'output/EP001-EP008-v4';P=ROOT/'production/v4';S=P/'share';S.mkdir(exist_ok=True)
chapters=json.loads((OUT/'chapters.json').read_text())
buttons=''.join(f'<button data-seek="{c["start_seconds"]}">EP{c["episode"]:03d} · {html.escape(c["title"])}</button>' for c in chapters)
page='''<!doctype html><html lang="zh-CN"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>山姆1—8集 · 配音紧凑叠化版 v4</title><style>body{background:#111823;color:#f3f4f7;font:16px system-ui,"PingFang SC",sans-serif;margin:0}main{max-width:1100px;margin:28px auto;padding:0 18px}h1{font-size:27px}p{line-height:1.8;color:#bbc9df}video{width:100%;background:black;border-radius:12px}a{color:#93d0ff}button{background:#253a54;color:white;border:1px solid #496281;border-radius:8px;padding:10px 13px;margin:5px 7px 5px 0;cursor:pointer}.links{display:flex;gap:24px;margin:22px 0;flex-wrap:wrap}#status{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}</style><main><h1>丧尸爆发后，我拥有整个山姆超市</h1><p>用户最终配音版重剪 · 4分04.77秒 · v4<br>保留原配音与画内字幕，删减句尾等待，换画面采用短叠化。</p><video id="film" controls preload="metadata" playsinline src="EP001-EP008_sams_apocalypse_v4.mp4"></video><p id="status">点击播放，以正常1倍速查看台词接续。</p><div><button id="play">从头播放</button><button id="speed">播放速度 1×</button></div><nav>CHAPTERS</nav><div class="links"><a href="EP001-EP008_sams_apocalypse_v4.mp4" download>下载重剪 MP4</a><a href="EP001-EP008_sams_apocalypse_v4.zh-CN.srt" download>下载重排 SRT</a><a href="EP001-EP008_v4_subtitles.zip" download>下载字幕 ZIP</a></div><p>原文件保留。源视频为960×544、30fps，本版保持相同画幅。页面不再叠加外挂字幕，避免与已有画内字幕重复。Cloudflare为临时分享，需要本机保持在线。</p></main><script>const v=document.querySelector('video');const status=document.querySelector('#status');document.querySelector('#play').onclick=()=>{v.currentTime=0;v.play().catch(()=>{})};document.querySelector('#speed').onclick=()=>{const rates=[1,1.25,1.5,2,4,8];v.playbackRate=rates[(rates.indexOf(v.playbackRate)+1)%rates.length];document.querySelector('#speed').textContent='播放速度 '+v.playbackRate+'×'};document.querySelectorAll('[data-seek]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{v.currentTime=Number(b.dataset.seek);v.play().catch(()=>{})});v.addEventListener('timeupdate',()=>{status.textContent='已播放 '+v.currentTime.toFixed(2)+' / '+v.duration.toFixed(2)+' 秒 · '+v.playbackRate+'×'});v.addEventListener('ended',()=>{status.textContent='播放完毕 · '+v.duration.toFixed(2)+' 秒'});v.addEventListener('error',()=>{status.textContent='播放错误：'+(v.error?.message||'未知')});</script></html>'''.replace('CHAPTERS',buttons)
